VALUES ('b284bcf3-bb98-5dd4-84d3-2211c254b43c'::uuid, '156b933d-f549-5fba-9b1b-797178d4b778'::uuid, 'engage'::public.lte_6e_stage, 1, 'Enter the workplace mission, learner role, pressure, authority boundary and required module outcome. The Workflow Owner cannot review the case efficiently because the supplied request, instruction, sources, output, status, observation and owner objects are not yet organised into a clear workflow structure. The learner must identify each object type, map its place and show confirmed, unconfirmed and review-layer relationships without inventing source use.', 'The Workflow Owner cannot review the case efficiently because the supplied request, instruction, sources, output, status, observation and owner objects are not yet organised into a clear workflow structure. The learner must identify each object type, map its place and show confirmed, unconfirmed and review-layer relationships without inventing source use.', '{"course_problem": "Northstar Retail is preparing a GenAI customer-support assistant that answers customer questions using approved business information. A generated response appears polished and confident, but the supplied records may show conflict with an approved source, internal-use information appearing in customer-facing output, incomplete review evidence, unclear source or review status, and deadline pressure encouraging premature use. The learner must inspect supplied records, identify workflow objects, classify evidence, recognise visible quality, evidence and boundary signals, record uncertainty, organise a safe review handoff and prepare a permitted first review action without diagnosing the technical cause, changing the response, approving the output or closing the case.", "module_problem": "The Workflow Owner cannot review the case efficiently because the supplied request, instruction, sources, output, status, observation and owner objects are not yet organised into a clear workflow structure. The learner must identify each object type, map its place and show confirmed, unconfirmed and review-layer relationships without inventing source use.", "artifact": "Annotated GenAI Workflow Map", "artifact_statement": "Create a complete annotated map of all supplied objects, their roles, their controlled relationships, the unconfirmed source connection and the explicit handoff to OWN-001."}'::jsonb, TRUE)
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
