VALUES ('fa0a6e67-dedf-5eb3-a3dd-620769d8e153'::uuid, '64dabe31-a154-5670-a16c-683d3c6c46c8'::uuid, 'explore'::public.lte_6e_stage, 2, 'Inspect the module-specific evidence and make a human-first observation or classification before support. The Module 4 handoff contains several Priority 1 signals. OWN-001 assigns S-006, the customer-facing exposure of internal-use content, as the first issue. The learner must prepare one safe, evidence-linked, reversible review-support action without changing the response or making the ownerâ€™s decision.', 'The Module 4 handoff contains several Priority 1 signals. OWN-001 assigns S-006, the customer-facing exposure of internal-use content, as the first issue. The learner must prepare one safe, evidence-linked, reversible review-support action without changing the response or making the ownerâ€™s decision.', '{"course_problem": "Northstar Retail is preparing a GenAI customer-support assistant that answers customer questions using approved business information. A generated response appears polished and confident, but the supplied records may show conflict with an approved source, internal-use information appearing in customer-facing output, incomplete review evidence, unclear source or review status, and deadline pressure encouraging premature use. The learner must inspect supplied records, identify workflow objects, classify evidence, recognise visible quality, evidence and boundary signals, record uncertainty, organise a safe review handoff and prepare a permitted first review action without diagnosing the technical cause, changing the response, approving the output or closing the case.", "module_problem": "The Module 4 handoff contains several Priority 1 signals. OWN-001 assigns S-006, the customer-facing exposure of internal-use content, as the first issue. The learner must prepare one safe, evidence-linked, reversible review-support action without changing the response or making the ownerâ€™s decision.", "artifact": "Safe First Review Action Record", "artifact_statement": "Create one action record for the assigned S-006 issue that includes exact evidence, permitted action category, required owner review, accountable receiver, preserved uncertainty and an explicit learner authority boundary."}'::jsonb, TRUE)
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
