L1 authority.", "artifact": "L1 Evidence Review Portfolio and Transfer Pack", "artifact_statement": "Create a final portfolio pack containing the selected evidence from M0â€“M5, A01/A02 improvement proof, reflection, and a completed parallel-case workflow review artifact demonstrating independent L1 recognition and handoff."}'::jsonb, TRUE)
