VALUES ('26295393-2a75-5a81-86e6-3e7064fc67d9'::uuid, '639e3598-14a3-539b-9968-0105fba213c5'::uuid, 'explain'::public.lte_6e_stage, 3, 'Learn the approved procedure, concepts, controls and escalation rules needed to complete the assigned task. The test package contains one authorised routine revision and one unresolved exception. The learner must make only the permitted change, rerun the affected test, preserve version history and submit the complete supported-build evidence to the owner.', 'The test package contains one authorised routine revision and one unresolved exception. The learner must make only the permitted change, rerun the affected test, preserve version history and submit the complete supported-build evidence to the owner.', '{"course_problem": "Northstar Retail needs a controlled GenAI customer-support workflow prepared for sandbox testing. The GenAI Workflow Owner supplies an approved workflow request, a structured prompt template, approved and restricted source records, a controlled sandbox, defined test cases and permitted revision rules. The learner must complete assigned workflow fields, assemble approved prompt components, connect permitted source context, run supplied tests, record evidence, make only explicitly permitted routine revisions and submit a versioned evidence pack. The learner may not independently design the complete workflow, use unapproved sources, change protected controls, approve customer-facing output, deploy to production or close significant exceptions.", "module_problem": "The test package contains one authorised routine revision and one unresolved exception. The learner must make only the permitted change, rerun the affected test, preserve version history and submit the complete supported-build evidence to the owner.", "artifact": "Supported GenAI Workflow Build and Test Pack", "artifact_statement": "Create a final integrated pack containing requirements, prompt version, approved source connection, sandbox setup, test evidence, authorised revision, retest result, unresolved exception, version history and owner handoff."}'::jsonb, TRUE)
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
